<title>UK: JFM sets 300 million guilder 10-year bond, +17 bp.</title>
<headline>JFM sets 300 million guilder 10-year bond, +17 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ING Barings and Yamaichi.</p>
<p> BORROWER   JAPAN FINANCE CORP FOR MUNICIPAL ENTERPRISES</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DFL   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    13.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.949   PAY DATE    13.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.274    SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-1M   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.675     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
